  "strategyNotes": [
    "Weather passages are day-by-day. Make a mini calendar as you read: 月 雨, 火 雨, 水 晴れ ...",
    "〜によると introduces a source (the TV forecast). Facts after it are what the forecast says.",
    "まだわかりません (not known yet) is a classic trap: do not assume Saturday is sunny."
